  The installer placed every file it could safely write, but
  some files already existed (skipped, never overwritten) and
  some setup steps require decisions only you can make.

  Skipped files (already on disk or write failed — not overwritten):
    1. CLAUDE.md — AIDE methodology pointer stub already present
    2. .aide/docs/aide-spec.md — already present
    3. .aide/docs/progressive-disclosure.md — already present
    4. .claude/commands/aide/research.md — already present
